{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54453","headline":"颂曰 · 张永进","name":"颂曰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白银枪悬太白旗，白虎三旌三戟枝。\n五方色中白爲上，不是我王争得知。\n楼成白璧耸仪形，蜀地求才赞圣明。\n自从汤帝昇遐後，白雀无因宿帝廷。\n今来降瑞报成康，果见河西再册[王]（玉）。\n韩白满朝谋似雨，国门长镇成炖煌。\n（以上二首均见伯二五九四、伯二八六四卷，参王重民《金山国坠简零拾》，收入《敦煌遗书论文集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张永进","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}